==Notes==
This quest is repeatable daily
==To Start==
Speak with [[Sunstone Jones]] located in [[Sanctuary]] during [[Lost Treasures Month]].
==Goals==
Complete combat encounters to collect lost treasure map scraps.
*Map Scraps Collected - /3
*Return to Sunstone Jones
*Find Kara Loft
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Sunstone Jones]] located in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"There's treasure out there for the taking. Trust me. There's just one thing... you'll need a map.<br /><br />Rumor has it combat encounters reward secret treasure map scraps when completed. So why don't you go completed some and see what you find?" -Sunstone Jones
#Map Scraps Collected - /3
#*Collect map scraps by completing [[Combat]] [[:category:Battle|Battles]].
#Speak with [[Sunstone Jones]] located in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"Nice work, kid. Now you need someone with the brains to assemble these scraps, and I know just the woman.<br /><br />A colleague of mine, Kara Loft. Last seen exploring just outside Sanctuary. Track her down and she'll send you in the right direction." -Sunstone Jones
#Speak with [[Kara Loft]] found northwest of the [[Sanctuary]] [[warpstone]].
#*"I understand Jones sent you? Lovely chap. I owe him a few favors so perhaps I can help you out...<br /><br />Hmmm. Yes. I believe I can assemble these scraps. Check back with me in a few moments and I should have a map for you." -Kara Loft
